Write Before Christmas is a tv movie, romance film directed by Pat Williams.

2
00:07:49,565 --> 00:07:55,565
A recently single Jessica sends Christmas cards to people who have impacted her life—the aunt who raised her, her younger brother in the military, a
popstar who was part of the soundtrack of her life, the music teacher who inspired her, and the best friend who always tells the truth.

